ssues/1004#issuecomment-1066118405","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/alembic/issues/1004","id":1066118405,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCX47u84_i60F","user":{"login":"cansjt","id":54809532,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0ODA5NTMy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54809532?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cansjt","html_url":"https://github.com/cansjt","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cansjt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cansjt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cansjt/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cansjt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cansjt/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cansjt/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cansjt/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cansjt/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cansjt/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2022-03-13T14:52:53Z","updated_at":"2022-03-13T14:52:53Z","body":"The issue seems to be on [line 213, in `alembic/operations/schemaobj.py`](https://github.com/sqlalchemy/alembic/blob/2719c0ef1917af0b74b9d642a75c9b6dd5cf537a/alembic/operations/schemaobj.py#L213), adding the `column` Column does add the constraint to the table.\r\n\r\nIt is then copied and added again in the list comprehension on [l. 215](https://github.com/sqlalchemy/alembic/blob/2719c0ef1917af0b74b9d642a75c9b6dd5cf537a/alembic/operations/schemaobj.py#L215).\r\n\r\nThe following patch fixes the issue:\r\n```diff\r\ndiff --git a/alembic/operations/schemaobj.py b/alembic/operations/schemaobj.py\r\nindex c8fab93..afba786 100644\r\n--- a/alembic/operations/schemaobj.py\r\n+++ b/alembic/operations/schemaobj.py\r\n@@ -214,7 +214,7 @@ class SchemaObjects:\r\n \r\n         constraints = [\r\n             sqla_compat._copy(elem, target_table=t)\r\n-            if getattr(elem, \"parent\", None) is not None\r\n+            if getattr(elem, \"parent\", None) is not t and getattr(elem, \"parent\", None) is not None\r\n             else elem\r\n             for elem in columns\r\n             if isinstance(elem, (Constraint, Index))\r\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/alembic/issues/comments/1066118405/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"cansjt","id":54809532,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0ODA5NTMy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54809532?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cansjt","html_url":"https://github.com/cansjt","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cansjt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cansjt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cansjt/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cansjt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cansjt/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cansjt/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cansjt/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cansjt/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cansjt/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/alembic/issues/comments/1066118977","html_url":"https://github.com/sqlalchemy/alembic/issues/1004#issuecomment-1066118977","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/alembic/issues/1004","id":1066118977,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCX47u84_i69B","user":{"login":"zzzeek","id":128223,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyODIyMw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/128223?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek","